@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Assessment Generation and Human Review
actor Lecturer
participant UI
participant Authorization as Auth
participant Orchestrator as AI
participant "Assessment Service" as Assess
participant "Validation Service" as Validate
participant "Version Service" as Version
Lecturer -> UI : Create 50-mark test mapped to outcomes
UI -> Auth : verify authoring scope
Auth --> UI : allowed
UI -> AI : task + context
AI -> Assess : generate blueprint, questions and memorandum
Assess --> AI : structured draft
AI -> Validate : check marks, clarity, duplication and level
Validate --> AI : findings/corrections
AI -> Version : create Draft version
Version --> AI : version ID
AI --> UI : inline assessment + human-review status
Lecturer -> UI : revise/submit for moderation
@enduml
